                                                "sense_id": "f15d2b76-8641-3418-a608-0656866cee85",
                                                "text": "Be thou a Flatterer now, and ſeeke to thriue / By that which ha's^([sic – meaning has]) vndone thee; hindge thy knee, / And let his very breath whom thou'lt obſerue / Blow off thy Cap: [...]"
